cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ClavisCage in your work, please cite the software and the method papers for the
  algorithms you used (listed under references).
type: software
title: ClavisCage
abstract: >-
  A browser-local workspace for clathrate-hydrate cage analysis: TRACE, HTR, GRADE, CHILL+, F3/F4
  and guest occupancy, with periodic-boundary-aware visualization and export.
